        "heading": "Virtual Staging Las Vegas, NV",
        "lede": "Virtual staging is the digital process of adding furniture and decor to photos of vacant or cleared rooms — home staging done in the pictures instead of the house, so buyers can imagine living there with no furniture rental and no install day. Vegas moves fast — investors, relocations and second-home buyers shopping from out of state — and Bella's designers stage Las Vegas listings in 24 to 48 hours, from {price:virtual-staging} a photo.",
