            "answer": "Physical staging in Las Vegas is quoted per home by the stager — size, number of rooms and how long the furniture stays all move the price. As a general benchmark, conventional staging runs about $2,000–5,000 a month until the home sells. Virtual staging from Bella is {price:virtual-staging} a photo, paid once."
