        "q11": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Should I professionally stage a vacant home in Las Vegas?",
            "answer": "If most buyers will see it online first, staging the photos covers most of the benefit. Professional physical staging helps at in-person showings but means a furniture rental; virtual staging stages the listing photos for {price:virtual-staging} each, and you can still stage in person later."
